# Antigravity Starter Kit - Git Ignore Rules
# Ignore everything by default
*

# Explicitly whitelist only the portable Starter Kit files
!.gitignore
!GEMINI.md
!README.md

!agents/
!agents/COMMON_INSTRUCTIONS.md
!agents/orchestrator/
!agents/orchestrator/AGENT.md
!agents/agent-default/
!agents/agent-default/AGENT.md

!memory/
!memory/mem
!memory/CORE.template.md
!memory/tests/
!memory/tests/**
